{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/494462/", "pk": 494462, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/", "pk": 929, "shortname": "livingoceanscuba", "name": "Living Ocean Tours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Deluxe Snorkel and Wildlife Cruise", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 3, "unicode": "Deluxe Snorkel and Wildlife Cruise", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": false, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 1.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": true, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 12500, "description": "Experience the ultimate island adventure with our Boat Tour in Waikiki, Hawaii! Get ready to cast off on an unforgettable journey that combines the beauty of the Pacific Ocean, thrilling water activities, and the chance to encounter incredible marine life.\n\nAs the tour begins, we depart from the bustling Kewalo Basin harbor and embark on a short boat ride to our anchorage near Waikiki. Here, the magic truly begins. Dive into the beautiful blue waters of the Pacific Ocean and revel in the freedom of swimming in paradise. Whether you're a seasoned water enthusiast or a novice, you're in for a treat!\n\nDuring our 90 minutes of aquatic bliss, you'll have access to our thrilling 20ft waterslide and a bouncy water trampoline that'll have you feeling like a kid again. If you prefer a more leisurely experience, grab a pool noodle and float gently on the tranquil waves, savoring the serenity of the ocean. Snorkeling equipment is also available for your use throughout the excursion.\n\nBut the adventure doesn't stop there! After leaving our anchorage, we embark on a captivating coastal cruise towards the iconic Diamond Head. Along the way, keep your eyes peeled for enchanting encounters with marine life. Spot graceful sea turtles and playful dolphins. If you're joining us between December and April, get ready for the show of a lifetime, as humpback whales make their grand appearance in these warm Hawaiian waters.\n\nThroughout the tour, your comfort is our priority. We'll keep you refreshed with complimentary sodas and water. It's the perfect blend of adventure and relaxation!\n\nJoin us for an unforgettable day of sun, sea, and smiles on our Boat Tour in Waikiki, Hawaii. Embrace the Hawaiian spirit and create cherished memories that will last a lifetime. Book your tour today and get ready to make a splash in paradise!", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "##Sea Sickness\nWe recommend taking sea sick medication if you are not regularly on the ocean. Please follow the directions on the package / a medical professional. It needs to be taken prior coming to the boat and/or the night before to be affective. Sea sickness medication is available as an over the counter medication at local pharmacies. As it needs to be taken prior to arrival we do not have sea sickness medication available on the boat. \n\n##What to Bring\n- Towels\n- Hat, Sunglasses, Sunscreen\n- Wear Swimming Attire\n- Cameras\n- Crew Gratuity (not required)\n\n**Full Face Masks** - For your safety we do not permit full snorkeling masks on our tours\n\n###Additional Information\n\n**Sea Sickness** - Generally the ocean is calm near Waikiki, but if you are prone to sea sickness or are not accustomed to being aboard ocean going boats we suggest you consult your doctor or pharmacist about taking preventative measures prior to your trip.\n\n**Departure Time / Late Arrivals**  - Out of respect to our guests we attempt to leave on time for every trip. If you are running late and do not arrive at the boat prior to the scheduled departure time your ticket will be forfeited. Refunds cannot be processed for no-shows / late arrivals so please plan ahead and arrive on time.\n\n*Refund Requests*\n\nIf you would like to request a refund due to unforeseen circumstances please visit our partner [TourClaim](https://link.getcopernican.com/livingoceanscuba) and submit a refund request.", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Waikiki's Snorkel and Ocean Playground", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/494462/images/1278142/", "pk": 1278142, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Pbf5qvLTQXWn0DN5PWGT", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Pbf5qvLTQXWn0DN5PWGT", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/494462/"}, "crop": {"x": 0, "y": 41, "width": 2560, "height": 1347, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WPgmnkKwTKmf1SGh8t6s"}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WPgmnkKwTKmf1SGh8t6s", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/WPgmnkKwTKmf1SGh8t6s", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/livingoceanscuba/items/494462/images/1083339/", "pk": 1083339, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/Su0IdBHYSWCoXRxoBmSy", "image_cdn_url": 